ried GYPT during that window and left with a broken game, we're sorry. Please give it another go: your first pharaoh is waiting. Your feedback shapes the full game. Tell us how your run went: https://tally.so/r/9NGe71 And if you enjoy the demo, adding GYPT to your wishlist is the best way to support our small studio. Thank you! Sophie & the Be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T06:46:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027740","verified_at":"2026-10-21T10:21:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5147850-1846651706688215","game_id":"steam-5147850","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer livestream: building the pharaoh's tombs!","summary":"Welcome to the livestream of my ancient Egypt management game!In this stream, I play the demo from start to finish: building the pharaoh's tombs, from the mastaba to the pyramid, managing workers and resources (limestone, acacia, brick, gold, papyrus, lapis lazuli), and facing unexpected events along the way.This is a no-commentary stream, but I'm reading the chat: feel free to ask questions, I'll answer in writing.The demo is free to play throughout Steam Next Fest. If you enjoy it, please add ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:35:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688215","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:30:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5147850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:47:03Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:47:03Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5147850":"2026-10-26T08:47:03Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5147850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:47:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:47:03Z","status":"ok","e